2. Architecture & Principles
BUSINESS → PRODUCT → RECIPE VERSION → INGREDIENTS / COST / SOP / TRAINING / QC
↓
STAFF + INVENTORY
↓
PERFORMANCE DATA
• Every business-owned record is tenant-isolated.
• Published recipe versions are immutable; edits create a new version.
• Costs use purchase price, pack size and usable yield.
• Staff see the current published recipe by default.
• Important actions are timestamped and attributable.
• Mobile-responsive web is mandatory for workstation use.
